# Only for `npm run preview` (wrangler dev on the built Worker). Copy to .dev.vars.
# Local R2 is simulated by wrangler, so serve images from this Worker under
# /event/media instead of the bucket's public domain in wrangler.jsonc.
# (`astro dev` needs none of this: it serves them there on its own.)
R2_PUBLIC_URL=/event/media
